// blackList: third-party packages known not to work with this system, or whose
// function is now built in (magic pointer).  IsSirNotAppearingInThisROM
// (builtinFunctions.ns) looks a package's name up here (BFetch, so the array
// is kept sorted by packageName) - after vars.SirNotAppearingInThisROM, a list
// a patch may add - and refuses to install or activate a package whose
// version is at most the entry's version, telling the user the entry's message.
// A version of 536870911, the largest integer, catches every version.

blackList := [|Array|:
	{packageName: "ActionNames&Agenda:IAMBIC", version: 19, message: @blackListGenericapology},
	{packageName: "ActionNames:IAMBIC", version: 19, message: @blackListGenericapology},
